<section><div class="wrap">
  <div class="eyebrow reveal">Netmaker hardening pattern</div>
  <h2 class="reveal d1">Control services become socket-backed, identity-gated surfaces.</h2>
  <p class="lead reveal d2" style="color:var(--mut)">The pattern treats <span class="mono">netmaker</span>, <span class="mono">netmaker-mq</span>, and <span class="mono">netmaker-ui</span> as loopback/socket services. Incus exposes Unix sockets under <span class="mono kv">/run/netmaker</span>. Xray terminates and routes by SNI behind WireGuard identity. The intended public posture is no direct Netmaker service port.</p>
