<section><div class="wrap">
  <div class="eyebrow reveal">Accountability loop</div>
  <h2 class="reveal d1">Chatbot on top. Semantic evidence underneath.</h2>
  <div class="grid g2" style="margin-top:18px">
    <div class="card reveal"><h3><span class="dot"></span>Header provenance</h3><p>Xray/OpenClaw metadata carries <span class="mono kv">X-Ghostbridge-Footprint</span>, <span class="mono kv">X-Ghostbridge-Trace-ID</span>, or WireGuard pubkey identity.</p></div>
    <div class="card reveal d1"><h3><span class="dot"></span>Snowball block</h3><p>Accepted action becomes a hash-linked block with previous hash, event hash, trace id, footprint, subid, actor, and capability.</p></div>
    <div class="card reveal"><h3><span class="dot"></span>Semantic projection</h3><p>Voyage embeds blocks, docs, transcripts, and chat turns. Qdrant makes meaning searchable. Cozo tracks graph/realtime relationships.</p></div>
    <div class="card reveal d1"><h3><span class="dot"></span>Cross-examination</h3><p>The model explains. The evidence pane verifies. If the explanation drifts, semantic receipts contradict it.</p></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section><div class="wrap">
  <div class="eyebrow reveal">AI and MCP surfaces</div>
  <h2 class="reveal d1">External clients enter through cognitive-mcp.</h2>
  <p class="lead reveal d2" style="color:var(--mut)">cognitive-mcp is the universal external gateway for NotebookLM, Droid/factory.ai, Cursor, Codex, Junie, Gemini CLI, and related clients. compact-mcp remains loopback/chatbot only. The gateway exposes memory, gRPC service, auth, tool surfaces, and context retrieval.</p>
  <div class="grid g3" style="margin-top:18px">
    <div class="card reveal"><h3><span class="dot"></span>cognitive-mcp</h3><p>Universal MCP gateway, memory tools, gRPC service, auth, and protocol surface.</p></div>
    <div class="card reveal d1"><h3><span class="dot"></span>ZeroClaw</h3><p>Routes to the right model/provider by cost, reasoning depth, policy, specialty, and structured output needs.</p></div>
    <div class="card reveal d2"><h3><span class="dot"></span>NotebookLM path</h3><p>Notebook/imported context becomes source material for vectorization and semantic evidence, not an authority bypass.</p></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

