<section><div class="wrap">
  <div class="eyebrow reveal">Core philosophies</div>
  <h2 class="reveal d1">What cannot be verified does not exist.</h2>
  <div class="grid g3" style="margin-top:18px">
    <div class="card reveal"><h3><span class="dot"></span>No verified schema, no existence</h3><p>If a thing has no validated schema, it is not a real object in this system. That is the primary attack boundary and the primary source of truth.</p></div>
    <div class="card reveal d1"><h3><span class="dot"></span>Single source of truth</h3><p>Schema-backed D-Bus projection is authoritative. UI, gRPC, MCP, search, and evidence are projections or transports, not alternate realities.</p></div>
    <div class="card reveal d2"><h3><span class="dot"></span>Use live resources</h3><p>Build from working realtime resources that already exist. Let current evidence shape the future state instead of searching for hypothetical resources to invent later.</p></div>
    <div class="card reveal"><h3><span class="dot"></span>Reality first</h3><p>Prefer observed state, live traces, and actual object graphs over claims, intentions, or clean-room abstractions.</p></div>
    <div class="card reveal d1"><h3><span class="dot"></span>Future from present</h3><p>The future is shaped by what is already running, measurable, and schema-valid today. That is how the platform stays grounded.</p></div>
    <div class="card reveal d2"><h3><span class="dot"></span>No speculative resources</h3><p>We do not “find resources to use in the future.” We use current realtime resources to build the next state from the current one.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="svgwrap reveal d3" style="margin-top:18px">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 1160 220" width="100%" aria-label="Core philosophies">
      <defs><marker id="arrowP" markerWidth="10" markerHeight="10" refX="7" refY="3" orient="auto"><path d="M0,0 L7,3 L0,6 Z" fill="#68758d"/></marker></defs>
