    <div class="card reveal"><h3><span class="dot"></span>Tonic</h3><p>The gRPC implementation in Rust. It fits the control plane because it keeps service transport type-safe, schema-driven, and local-socket friendly.</p></div>
    <div class="card reveal d1"><h3><span class="dot"></span>Gemma</h3><p>The traffic classifier/router for the front of the pipeline. Gemma decides what a request is before Xray/OpenFlow decide where it should go.</p></div>
